<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:10:05 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>随着出口再次飙升，刚果接近最大铜供应国智利</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-closes-on-top-copper-supplier-chile-as-exports-soar-again</link><description>刚果民主共和国正在缩小与世界最大铜生产国智利的差距，该国季度出口量在截至 9 月份的三个月内首次突破 100 万吨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-closes-on-top-copper-supplier-chile-as-exports-soar-again'&gt;随着出口再次飙升，刚果接近最大铜供应国智利&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Congo Closes on Top Copper Supplier Chile as Exports Soar Again&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-closes-on-top-copper-supplier-chile-as-exports-soar-again</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:24:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>BBVA 考虑使用 SRT 对冲约 5 亿美元的数据中心贷款</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bbva-weighs-srt-to-hedge-about-500-million-of-data-center-loans</link><description>BBVA SA 正在考虑一项交易，以减轻约 5 亿欧元（5.47 亿美元）数据中心贷款的风险，世界各地的银行都在探索多种方法来对冲人工智能相关基础设施的风险。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bbva-weighs-srt-to-hedge-about-500-million-of-data-center-loans'&gt;BBVA 考虑使用 SRT 对冲约 5 亿美元的数据中心贷款&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：BBVA Weighs SRT to Hedge About $500 Million of Data Center Loans&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bbva-weighs-srt-to-hedge-about-500-million-of-data-center-loans</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:27:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着矿业繁荣，刚果推出 150 亿美元的基础设施交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-pitches-15-billion-infrastructure-deals-as-mining-booms</link><description>刚果民主共和国正在投资 150 亿美元用于铁路和其他基础设施项目，因为该国正经历铜矿开采热潮，政府希望铜矿开采将改变这个中非国家的贸易和运输。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-pitches-15-billion-infrastructure-deals-as-mining-booms'&gt;随着矿业繁荣，刚果推出 150 亿美元的基础设施交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Congo Pitches $15 Billion Infrastructure Deals as Mining Booms&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-pitches-15-billion-infrastructure-deals-as-mining-booms</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:28:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着家庭债务飙升，巴西收紧消费贷款规则</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/brazil-tightens-consumer-lending-rules-as-household-debt-soars</link><description>由于巴西总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦对家庭债务飙升越来越担忧，巴西央行公布了遏制消费者过度借贷的措施。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/brazil-tightens-consumer-lending-rules-as-household-debt-soars'&gt;随着家庭债务飙升，巴西收紧消费贷款规则&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil Tightens Consumer Lending Rules as Household Debt Soars&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/brazil-tightens-consumer-lending-rules-as-household-debt-soars</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:54:50 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>